'''Insane Rhythms (Merciless)''' is the second and final stage of [[Clan of the Maniacs]]. It features every [[:Category:Crazed Cats|Crazed Cat]] enemy variant. It is a [[No Continues]] stage. Unlike [[The Wild Dance (Deadly)|The Wild Dance]], each Crazed Cat spawns all at once, rather than at different rates. Beating this stage for the first time will drop 2 [[Cat Capsule|Rare Tickets]].

