==Strategy==
Rich Cat is recommended due to heavily limited money. As for the lineup, you should have something to quickly kill traitless enemies from a safe distance, cheap meatshields, and knockback cats (e.g. [[Sniper the Recruit (Super Rare Cat)|Sniper the Heavy]], [[Kubiluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Kubilan Pasalan]] etc.), as spamming meatshields is the only way to withstand the quick attacks. Due to their ridiculous DPS when all attacking together, these enemies can quickly shred most tankers; however, [[Ancient Egg: N001 (Special Cat)|Haniwa Cat]] performs very well against everything except the Crazed Bird Cat as it targets them.

